# Suppressions for `make cppcheck`. See docs/dev/build.md.
#
# The library is analysed on its own, without the integrator code that calls it,
# so every public API function looks both unused and internally linkable.
unusedFunction
staticFunction

# Signatures are pinned by the function-pointer tables the handlers are stored in;
# cppcheck flags that risk in the message itself.
constParameterCallback

# Informational, not defects: standard headers are not provided on purpose, and
# the remaining #ifdef combinations are config knobs, not code paths to audit.
missingIncludeSystem
toomanyconfigs
checkersReport
